& [Purpose] is a pure non-authorizing representation waist
  + represent two caller-declared complete acquisition lineages under one exact common scope
  + represent an explicit first-completion-before-second-start causal claim without clock observation
  + independently validate and rederive complete current carrier ancestry
  + retain current Equal reconciliation as necessary and insufficient
  + release only one output-only ClaimOnly repeated-inventory equality record
  + leave physical acquisition, producer admission, issuance, receipt conversion, consumption, and present truth absent

& [AuthorityDelineation] is closed
  + ClaimForm is caller-authored inspectable supplied data
