  + ClaimOnlyResult is output-only but non-authoritative
  + ProductionAdmittedLineage is absent
  + IssuedEvidence is absent
  + IssuedReceipt is absent
  + ConsumptionDecision is absent
  + PhysicalTruth remains external to profile 0.1
  - never: infer an absent authority stage from private fields, serde, validation, carrier ancestry, rederivation, Equal, or serialization

& [AcquisitionIdentity] is exact logical correlation
  + representation is one private nonzero u64 value
  + zero is invalid
  + equality and inequality are exact and canonical
  + serde round trip is stable and allocation free
  + no generator is provided
  + no uniqueness, collision freedom, event occurrence, producer identity, nonce, time, order, proof, or capability is claimed
