  + exact current ordered topology inventory digest reconciliation profile
  + exact current ordered topology observation encoding profile
  + one complete current TopologyScanLimits value
  + one exact closed policy digest
  + exact predecessor admission profile
  + exact predecessor receipt digest
  + equality compares every coordinate structurally
  - no separate scope identity, omitted coordinate, option, wildcard, default, alias, partial comparator, or caller summary exists

& [CompletionDisposition] is closed
  + CompleteClaimed is the only variant
  + it states the claim author's declaration for pure reasoning
  - not: observed, actual, proven, trusted, admitted, issued, successful traversal, or fault absence

& [AcquisitionLineageClaim] owns complete pure ancestry
  + one exact AcquisitionIdentity
  + one exact AcquisitionScopeClaim
  + exact CompletionDisposition CompleteClaimed
  + one complete current ordered topology inventory digest carrier
  + the digest carrier owns its current inventory assembly and every transitive supplied ancestor
  + current nested validation and digest derivation rerun before acceptance
  - no peer assembly field, bare digest, loose assembly, locator, key, lazy lookup, mutable pointer, or caller summary exists
  - supplied carrier ancestry never proves physical origin

& [CausalOrderClaim] is explicit and clock neutral
  + relation kind is exactly FirstCompletionStrictlyPrecedesSecondStart
  + exact first acquisition identity is the source endpoint
  + exact second acquisition identity is the target endpoint
  + identities must differ
  + endpoints and direction validate independently from pair storage
  - no clock, timestamp, tick, duration, deadline, freshness, vector-order, JSON-order, operand-order, numeric-order, or lexical-order inference exists
  - coherent declaration never proves either event occurred or that the relation was physically witnessed

& [OrderedAcquisitionPairClaim] has exact cardinality
