  + owns exactly one SecondAcquisition lineage
  + owns exactly one CausalOrderClaim
  + first and second identities must differ
  + first and second complete scopes must compare exactly equal
  + causal endpoints must match the role identities exactly
  - no zero, one, three, vector, open role set, role substitution, or one-lineage reuse exists

